When you need an uncompromised, bold caffeine kick, our classic Long Black is the answer. Crafted by pulling two shots of our premium signature espresso directly over hot water, this brewing style preserves the coffee''s delicate, velvety crema and intensifies its natural aroma. It’s rich, complex, and beautifully smooth. Grab yours to fuel a productive morning of remote work or to enjoy during a breezy afternoon stroll around Vibe@East Coast.Bold flavor, no distractions. Come get your fix! 🖤','','','https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/812946397_1698053031294242_4127198485894786597_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c7e7b7&_nc_ohc=Tempza9LCCAQ7kNvwGT7Elm&_nc_oc=Adoi4kKBJZF8S_XOrxv1z58Ice68ZJGjlcLDwqdzXWsnD540_lL3uSnNs_7TmQxx6YM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&edm=ABodE4kEAAAA&_nc_gid=7k5eIfIy8KBp1JEddT64Ow&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJFO6GPMm34mARePVh42xjNmeYYooD5tY69PPINKv-wBPnE3PwYz0gyosepyoUpnzYJdDEfZXsY0Q&oh=00_AQLtrdcNzwJhnQvldEaaF2KushM5cJVUFsBgQkm8ciM8Qw&oe=6AB86AEA','jwdcmxbzrx','https://www.beccas.cafe/long-black',NULL,33) RETURNING "id";
Transport your taste buds straight to the tropics with the all-new Coconut Latte. We combine two shots of our bold signature espresso with beautifully textured, creamy coconut milk, creating a silky-smooth cup with a natural, subtle sweetness. It is light, deeply refreshing, and pairs perfectly with the coastal breeze on our pet-friendly Vibe@East Coast deck.Whether you need a morning spark or a mid-day tropical escape, this new crowd-favorite is waiting for you! 🌴🌊','','','https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/806511735_2191115675083345_5788999321239362519_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c7e7b7&_nc_ohc=dpekBqIPgpIQ7kNvwG4EQZW&_nc_oc=AdrZ1Cgb4CpO9tjQbbL2BgGLYlIW4adF4Lnw_b0kqJl5NZciZBZERnn-RxWw7JiGhps&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&edm=ABodE4kEAAAA&_nc_gid=7k5eIfIy8KBp1JEddT64Ow&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK81sf5J684cy3jrfLx0Tce1RJoOQ6h2BSNJBL8CF-QWI9uL40JXnpHpKr3fgr5NyxJB8eGxNSyNw&oh=00_AQLriUdyBCp2UW-M1Bjqtve4s_x0MZIrzsWlp_jZ4tPxfA&oe=6AB8547E','zpz6fmt530','https://www.beccas.cafe/coconut-latte','{"https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/812803999_1105586052000334_6031867474466881713_n.jpg?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=657aed&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=sdRsoSexCksQ7kNvwE6SF1w&_nc_oc=AdpxCqfzbupS7pGKE5n3RTt1JwAXYsGZolD1ZiiukNePmACd_UYg0R0J2ZPBpopM-AA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&_nc_gid=99TavGRKWbE6dqMhODnA3A&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_AQJvpra8zx6VNbryml18UvxRhsMJYS6S6WLlcbDHZf8khA&oe=6AB322D5"}',34) RETURNING "id";
There’s a reason our Cappuccino is a certified favorite among the younger crowd at Vibe@East Coast. We pull a rich, velvety double shot of our specialty espresso and top it with thick, pillowy microfoam, creating the ultimate balance of bold coffee and creamy texture. It’s the perfect companion for your study sessions, remote work grinds, or catching up on your feed.Grab a hot cup for the perfect latte art, or order it iced for a smooth, refreshing afternoon pick-me-up! ✨📸','','','https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/815046385_1490039936507893_907315206024928895_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c7e7b7&_nc_ohc=wF-gkwcvpNoQ7kNvwHlxVyi&_nc_oc=Ado637a1MWiPOoiRHemjV7oRCzNf_I_rFCgIAlCfuB0W4pOGyp3hr1vPTq7L4cxgfRU&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&edm=ABodE4kEAAAA&_nc_gid=7k5eIfIy8KBp1JEddT64Ow&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJUZnTOdhoWnnvA930m-KajCFb2ByEKGmXl5TAu4-wCU1eih-B2qc-gvEh2_yXPnDaKsRsItBkctA&oh=00_AQJmJkuczgBwAoRg59nlhrzFf7ztQ5oemJcNl8Bhopew5g&oe=6AB8675A','1nsgi40mcj','https://www.beccas.cafe/cappuccino','{"https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/812803918_1127696873033504_5160709344360538667_n.jpg?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=657aed&_nc_ohc=98sLw9Xl0ZYQ7kNvwEeiUfp&_nc_oc=AdpbVGc2PIo-xrEomy2L4r6iqx-fEweGAjIaM4-W_CmjGoaWLwvy7mfXeMS_t6Qg8tY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&_nc_gid=99TavGRKWbE6dqMhODnA3A&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_AQKNBGL8iWHNjvqYDM7aybl8Aq7mZAXVlp0cJZbqynardg&oe=6AB2F8EC","https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/812804265_886306377749975_735700175727146275_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=657aed&_nc_ohc=tOWxqZG3rxwQ7kNvwGXlHp0&_nc_oc=AdppOjtjK8-WXVyaiEH0FiEDxH5lGCBgs4G7Sh_wEo8S4LJjF5_viSo5WAveKorhgF0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&_nc_gid=99TavGRKWbE6dqMhODnA3A&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_AQLLIuo7r-PZ7nCt2mI_q3_a26ZkkWlPGwYZaT_SQnlBog&oe=6AB2F1D6"}',35) RETURNING "id";
Sometimes, nothing beats the classics. Our signature Black Tea has been a beloved staple since day one, offering the ultimate comfort in every cup. Brewed to absolute perfection using premium, full-bodied loose leaves, it delivers a rich, robust flavor with a naturally smooth, clean finish. It is the perfect companion for a quiet morning reflection, a focused afternoon of remote work, or a cozy chat on our breezy Vibe@East Coast deck.Come back to the flavor you love—pour a cup with us today! 🍃🍂','','','https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/812804422_1460539559472861_4258535720941538751_n.jpg?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c7e7b7&_nc_ohc=0AKycNcyc0QQ7kNvwETPzB4&_nc_oc=AdqHF8pQwTPa49WnTQczvKvOVv4Ozw-Ds-0jY8EozKJ-b3PLXJRuenSp0hDOodZ0Drk&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&edm=ABodE4kEAAAA&_nc_gid=7k5eIfIy8KBp1JEddT64Ow&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJ-aHDIjJPG-rWCB4mRrM_n7ySGr3PWYTjxThaP0E9FcKyoTxVRAMJyyO8NSgLobKMpI_CtCoWfGw&oh=00_AQKZbbD8czrpRR9hGb2kYwbLfQXlLVG4EW_rTVTGeRbjww&oe=6AB85EF4','x2430x8oij','https://www.beccas.cafe/','{"https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/812804085_1499871735505946_520804579885985526_n.jpg?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=657aed&_nc_ohc=fqim6gpEGroQ7kNvwGex35F&_nc_oc=AdrnaNRr3xINYm_H7UOUyiMaspGOPJ6vSyUcOgGMbB5H-oxGAXcr_9yRzlyTIgvGnVY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&_nc_gid=99TavGRKWbE6dqMhODnA3A&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_AQKHOkE4GWmgtIpCKDNPJUW9ELTBSTQDzDh02iSkoxlsVg&oe=6AB31A33"}',36) RETURNING "id";

When the Singapore afternoon heat hits, our signature Cold Brew is the ultimate neighborhood savior. Steeped slowly in-house for over 16 hours using our premium specialty beans, this process removes all bitterness, leaving you with an incredibly smooth, crisp, and naturally sweet coffee. It is low in acidity, high in caffeine, and 100% refreshing. Grab a bottle before heading out to the beach or settle into our air-conditioned space at Vibe@East Coast for the perfect daily reset!Grab yours fresh from the fridge today! 🗺️✨','','','https://scontent.fsin10-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t45.5328-4/807881519_1390027916623689_5720080293063445173_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c7e7b7&_nc_ohc=r_SLmW-mD60Q7kNvwFM7YDT&_nc_oc=AdrHlXCMy0Hx3guZH9HV9fEH8fqoneZzCTsg5QGx3asBMPNXe6HvV-Gat3b6txcVs90&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fsin10-1.fna&edm=ABodE4kEAAAA&_nc_gid=7k5eIfIy8KBp1JEddT64Ow&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJyySaK2Fmwj9OoDiXLOEeAx57Y_H7B2L8cEtGtSF7jfOkS17vxMF7lxLJ5KBIuoYD2-VjU_o5RhQ&oh=00_AQKZTWWGXFBi-TZ7lAuVB4C6PQKio3bAwAvyOwwAKKiYZw&oe=6AB86986','2vop0imdee','https://www.beccas.cafe/cold-brew',NULL,37) RETURNING "id";

